<dialog id="design-dialog" aria-labelledby="design-title"><button type="button" id="design-close" aria-label="Close design details">×</button><p class="eyebrow" id="design-code"></p><h2 id="design-title"></h2><img id="design-image" alt=""><div id="design-views" aria-label="Choose image"></div><p id="design-description"></p><p id="design-production" class="design-quote"></p><div class="design-estimator" aria-labelledby="design-estimator-title"><h3 id="design-estimator-title">Estimate your price</h3><p>Enter the finished plate size in inches. For round designs, enter the diameter as both width and height.</p><div class="estimate-fields"><label for="design-width">Width (inches)<input id="design-width" type="number" min="1" step="0.25" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 15"></label><label for="design-height">Height (inches)<input id="design-height" type="number" min="1" step="0.25" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 8"></label></div><div id="design-estimate" class="estimate-result"><strong>Enter width and height to estimate the price.</strong><small>Final price is confirmed after artwork and production details are approved.</small></div></div><p><strong>Personalised to order · See it with your name</strong><br>Final dimensions and total are confirmed before production.</p><form id="design-form"><label for="design-text">What name or text would you like?</label><textarea id="design-text" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="Enter your text and house number, if needed"></textarea><details class="order-extras"><summary>Add size, lighting or colour (optional)</summary><label for="design-lighting">Lighting preference</label><select id="design-lighting"><option>Help me choose</option><option>Without LED</option><option>With LED, if suitable for this design</option></select><label for="design-notes">Colours or other changes (optional)</label><textarea id="design-notes" rows="2" maxlength="1000"></textarea></details><p class="payment-inline">Pay 30% after design finalisation and the remaining 70% on delivery. Delivery within 3–5 working days from order confirmation.</p><button type="submit" class="button primary">Send My Details on WhatsApp →</button><div id="design-ready" hidden><p>If WhatsApp did not open, use the button below. You can attach extra reference images in the chat.</p><a id="design-whatsapp" class="button primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open WhatsApp ↗</a></div></form></dialog>